WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.140
We're looking at vaccines in a special issue of science

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.780
because there's been a

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.770
loud, if small, minority of vaccine

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.510
resistors who've been getting a lot of

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.849
play lately and we feel it's really

00:00:11.849 --> 00:00:14.280
important to look at the facts and the

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.049
evidence around vaccines and the

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:18.930
tremendous public health benefit they've

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:20.850
delivered to us throughout the 20th

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:23.070
century and that they continue to do

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.440
I'm Meredith Wadman

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.880
I'm a reporter with Science magazine

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:28.740
One of the common misconceptions

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:30.760
around vaccines with hesitant parents

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:31.590
is this notion that

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:34.320
vaccines given in infancy can overwhelm

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.329
the baby's immune system or the

00:00:36.329 --> 00:00:39.040
toddler's immune system even if you gave

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:42.260
a one-year-old 11 vaccines in one sitting

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:45.600
that stimulus to that child's immune

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.500
system would so-called "use up"

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.760
only 0.1 percent of the immune system at that

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:55.860
point in time so we are tremendously

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.840
evolved to fight foreign invaders and

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.390
and the number of vaccines is just not

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:02.609
consequential in terms of where our

00:01:02.609 --> 00:01:05.670
immune systems abilities are.

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:08.070
when you look at the measles line what you see

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:10.770
there are literally millions of cases in

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:13.320
the middle of the 20th century going

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:15.509
down to thousands after the introduction

00:01:15.509 --> 00:01:19.650
of the measles vaccine in 1963

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:21.780
Measles was no joke, it was no fun for an

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:24.210
ordinary kid to have it, but for certain

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:26.670
children, Measles could kill you.

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:28.829
you look now into the late decades of

00:01:28.829 --> 00:01:31.079
the 20th century and Measles is more

00:01:31.079 --> 00:01:32.880
or less going away there's a bump in

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.590
'91 or '92 when there's an

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:38.090
outbreak, but then you get in 1998 this

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:41.579
since proven fraudulent paper in

00:01:41.579 --> 00:01:44.549
The Lancet from Andrew Wakefield suggesting

00:01:44.549 --> 00:01:47.040
that there's a link that MMR,

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.500
the measles, mumps, and rubella vaccine might cause

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.869
autism, but that had a really serious

00:01:51.869 --> 00:01:54.480
impact on vaccination uptake

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:57.540
for a number of years

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:00.220
Vaccine Court is a court in Washington, D.C.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.790
where a petitioner someone

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:05.100
who believes they have been injured by a

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:08.009
vaccine can bring a petition and seek

00:02:08.009 --> 00:02:10.350
redress in terms of financial

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:13.200
compensation for that injury

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:14.640
They look at the evidence

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:16.220
and they decide what are

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:18.800
bona fide vaccine injuries

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:20.660
By far the most common injury

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:22.280
where a needle is

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.360
mistakenly inserted into the shoulder

00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:26.250
joint rather than the upper arm and

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.800
causes a really painful and

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:29.280
long-lasting inflammation

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:30.810
The number of claims of

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:33.260
shoulder injuries is growing, I believe,

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:34.590
for a couple reasons

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:39.240
In 2005, the government added to the list

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:41.910
of vaccines against which one can bring

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:44.080
a claim at the vaccine court

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:46.980
the influenza vaccine and it so happened

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:50.780
that at that time the CDC also expanded

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:52.800
the recommendation for who should be

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:55.709
receiving that vaccine so as a result in

00:02:55.709 --> 00:02:57.270
the last decade you've had more than a

00:02:57.270 --> 00:03:00.390
billion with a 'B' doses of this vaccine

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:02.320
shipped more vaccines

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:04.140
more potential for injury

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.660
However, I think, one interesting

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.519
and salient point is that the court has

00:03:08.519 --> 00:03:13.320
never found that a vaccine caused a

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:15.720
child to develop autism

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:18.580
There was a big group claim

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:20.640
of more than 5,000 families

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:23.700
involved in this in the first decade of

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:25.620
this century and the court just said

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:27.740
"There's no there there."

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:28.920
You could come away with a very

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:30.480
skewed perception that

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.900
vaccines are incredibly risky

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:35.660
In fact, it's the other way around

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:38.519
If you are infected with tetanus in this country

00:03:38.519 --> 00:03:42.090
the mortality for any given individual

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:46.220
is at a risk of actually 13.2%

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:48.780
for any given person who contracts tetanus

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:50.540
the risk of getting a really severe

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.819
allergic reaction that can kill you

00:03:52.819 --> 00:03:56.030
is somewhere between one to six in every

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:59.540
million doses of tetanus vaccine administered

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:01.099
The risk reward calculus is

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:03.080
pretty obvious I think

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:07.840
You'd do far better to get your tetanus vaccine

